---
description: Prefix related DB/JSON fields so they sort together (e.g. scuTotal, scuSplits)
alwaysApply: true
---

# Field name namespaces (JSON / DB)

Prefer a **common prefix** (namespace) at the start of related field names so they cluster when JSON keys or schema columns are listed alphabetically / naturally.

## Rule

- Put the **shared concept first**, then the qualifier: `scuTotal`, `scuSplits`, `scuMaxContainerSize`.
- Avoid trailing-concept names that scatter related fields: `totalScu`, `maxContainerScu`.
- Same idea for SQL columns: `scu_total`, `scu_splits` (JSON), `scu_max_container_size`.
- Applies to Drizzle/TS properties, JSON payloads, and MCP tool argument names for the same data.

## Examples

```ts
// ❌ BAD — related SCU fields do not sort together
totalScu
maxContainerScu
cargo
// …many keys…
// total* and max* land far apart from each other

// ✅ GOOD — SCU family groups under `scu*`
scuMaxContainerSize
scuSplits
scuTotal
```

Catalog hauling (current):

| Use | Avoid |
| --- | --- |
| `scuTotal` | `totalScu` |
| `scuSplits` | ad-hoc split fields without the `scu` prefix |
| `scuLocationSplits` (`{ from: {slug:scu}, to: {slug:scu} }`) | flat location maps without `scu` prefix |
| `scuMaxContainerSize` | `maxContainerScu` |
| `scuBoxSplits` (`scuOne` / `scuTwo` / `scuFour` / `scuEight` / `scuSixteen` / `scuThirtyTwo`) — mission aggregate | `boxBreakdown`, `size1`, `oneScu` |
| `scuBoxSplitsAutoSelected` (aggregate greedy/capped default before user correction) | `autoBoxSplits`, `originalBoxSplits`, `defaultBreakdown` |
| `scuCargoBoxSplits` / `scuCargoBoxSplitsAutoSelected` (`Record<commoditySlug, ScuBoxSplits>`) | per-line mixes buried only on `cargo[]` without `scu` prefix; shared pool across commodities |
| `missionRunCount` / `missionTotalDurationMs` / `missionAvgDurationMs` | `runCount`, `totalDurationMs`, `avgDurationMs` |
| `contractorSlug` (FK to `contractors`) | free-text `contractor` on catalog rows |
| `rank` (Trainee…Master; no “Rank” suffix) | `repLevel`, `Junior Rank` as a stored value |
| `isDirect` / `isOnePickup` / `isOneDelivery` (from `scuLocationSplits`) | `routeType`, `directMission`, `nonDirect` as stored enum alone |
| `rewards` (`[{ kind: "auec", amount }]` / `blueprint`) | `rewardAuec` alone |
| `offerLocationSlug` / `offerStarSystemSlug` | bare `system`, `starSystem` without the `offer` family |

`objectives` (screenshot-style text bullets) stays separate — it is copy, not an SCU measure.

## When adding fields

1. Identify the family (`scu`, `reward`, `box`, …).
2. Name new members `{family}{Qualifier}` in camelCase (`scuFoo`).
3. Mirror in SQL as `{family}_{qualifier}` snake_case.
